note Trigger: the menu button at the end of the document toolbar (TOUR_MENU, doc-menu) opens the tour's menu; its row 'delete tour' (REMOVE_TOUR, doc-delete), a danger row (red, dark red under the pointer, answering only an aimed click), queues RemoveTour for the tour being read and closes the menu.

