file crates/gui/src/widgets.rs
symbol menu
lines 0 74
hash ea4b93bf3e3da901
note The menu: the button (Icon::Ellipsis, drawn on while open) toggles it; while open, a floating list right-aligned under the button, as wide as its longest item, one row per MenuItem lit under the pointer. A Danger row is red, dark red under the pointer and reads its interaction through when_aimed, so it fires only after the pointer moved onto it. A click on a row queues the item's action and closes the menu; a press outside the list closes it (while it is open only floating elements are hot, so the press never reaches what it lands on, the menu button included).

